// Eraser diagram type: Cloud Architecture
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

User [icon: user]

App server [icon: server, color: blue] {
  API [icon: fastapi]
  File storage [icon: hard-drive]
}

Job queue [icon: shuffle, color: orange] {
  Postgres SKIP LOCKED [icon: postgres]
  Celery with Redis [icon: redis]
  AWS SQS [icon: aws-sqs]
  Kafka topic [icon: kafka]
}

Import workers [icon: cpu, color: purple] {
  Chunk reader [icon: layers]
  Validator pool [icon: check-circle]
  Chunk writer [icon: save]
}

Database [icon: postgres, color: green] {
  imports [icon: list]
  contacts [icon: users]
  import_errors [icon: x-circle]
  import_events [icon: activity]
}

Calling layer [icon: phone, color: gray]

User > API: upload / map / poll / export
API > File storage: stream bytes + sha256
API > imports: create job and set queued
API > Job queue: enqueue import_id
Job queue > Chunk reader: deliver job
File storage > Chunk reader: stream file
Chunk reader > Validator pool: 10k-row chunks
Validator pool > Chunk writer: valid rows + rejects
Chunk writer > contacts: COPY + merge
Chunk writer > import_errors: COPY rejects
Chunk writer > imports: checkpoint + counters
Chunk writer > import_events: progress event
API > imports: read progress counters
API > contacts: keyset pages + CSV export
contacts > Calling layer: status pending
